    "## 8. Pandas real world mein kahan use hota hai?\n",
    "\n",
    "### E-commerce\n",
    "Product sales, customer orders, revenue, returns aur inventory analyze karne ke liye. Example: kis product ki sales sab se zyada hain?\n",
    "\n",
    "### Banking aur Finance\n",
    "Transactions, expenses, financial trends aur suspicious patterns ke analysis mein. Example: transactions mein unusual patterns identify karna.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Education\n",
    "Students ke marks, attendance, class results aur performance trends analyze karne mein. Example: subjects ke average marks compare karna.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Healthcare\n",
    "Properly authorized aur privacy-protected research datasets ko summarize aur analyze karne mein. Example: research data mein age groups ke hisaab se trends samajhna.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Digital Marketing\n",
    "Campaign performance, clicks, conversions aur customer engagement analyze karne mein. Example: kis campaign se zyada customers aaye?\n",
    "\n",
    "### Science aur Research\n",
    "Measurements, experiments, weather observations aur time-based data analyze karne mein. Example: mukhtalif months ke temperature trends compare karna.\n",
    "\n",
    "![Illustrative city sales chart](attachment:sales_chart.png)"
